;; ooyake 公 — authority-reference.edn
;;
;; A curated set of AUTHORITATIVE facts about government units — the kind of record
;; the R1 `reconcile` cell would otherwise FETCH from external authorities. Bundled
;; here so the reconcile DEMO (reconcile.py / ReconcileCell mode="bundled") is
;; runnable OFFLINE and deterministic; live network fetch is G4 + Council + operator
;; gated and is NOT what this file is.
;;
;; The reconcile cell promotes a seed unit :representative → :authoritative ONLY
;; when the unit's :gov.unit/wikidata AND :gov.unit/official-url both AGREE with the
;; authoritative record here (G5: agreement = verification, disagreement = stays
;; unverified + flagged).
;;
;; SOURCING POLICY (per founder 2026-06-03): :provenance cites EACH BODY'S OWN
;; official URL / document URL as the primary source of truth for the unit's
;; existence + identity (本体の url / 文書の url を一次ソースに). The Wikidata QID is
;; a cross-reference identifier only; its own entity page is recorded separately in
;; :wikidata-ref for traceability — it is NOT the primary provenance.
;;
;; QID INTEGRITY (2026-06-03): every Wikidata QID below was INDEPENDENTLY
;; re-verified against wikidata.org on 2026-06-03. A prior fabrication wave had
;; assigned a contiguous fake block (Q1023xxx) to the JP ministries (e.g. MOF was
;; "Q1023766" which actually resolves to CIUTI, a Brussels translators' association)
;; plus wrong QIDs for NTA/IRS/Treasury/HMRC/Shinjuku/Digital/Reconstruction. All
;; corrected here AND in the seeds. See MATURITY.md § "2026-06-03 QID integrity fix".

